{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UEujQDlsPx1793590355.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名女瑜伽導師2022年倒斃在油麻地一間酒店房間，前男友被控謀殺，早上在高等法院審理。</p><p></p><p>被告勞浚銘由囚車押至法庭應訊。</p><p></p><p>案情指，23歲瑜伽導師周慧賢，原定在2022年6月30日到美國上短期瑜伽課程，但家人發現她失蹤之後報警。被告之後到警署自首，指在香港麗思卡爾頓酒店房殺害周慧賢，死者身上有逾30處刀傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:40:49.158021+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":152,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:24:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:58:55.147282+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:38:11.265865+00:00","content_hash":"257f241f36b07a970381695ae912bb1058ad088a47b92b61df7c7c9d31042eb5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}